---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageIntro from "../components/PageIntro.astro";
import NoticeList from "../components/NoticeList.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Admissions & Notices" description="Official SAL Education admission circulars for the 2026–27 academic year and contacts for follow-up.">
  <PageIntro number="04" label="ADMISSIONS" eyebrow="Official circulars · 2026–27" title="Make your next step<br><em>an informed one.</em>" lead="Browse admission notices linked from SAL Education’s current home page. The circulars contain their own schedules and instructions." />
  <section class="section notice-section"><div class="container notice-layout"><div class="notice-intro"><div class="section-label light-label"><span>01</span><span class="label-rule"></span><span>BEFORE YOU APPLY</span></div><span class="eyebrow">Please check the dates</span><h2>Confirm what’s<br><em>open today.</em></h2><p>Some dates in the published 2026–27 circulars have passed. Contact the relevant institute before making travel or application plans.</p><a class="button button-light" href="/contact/">Contact admissions <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="notice-side-note"><span class="notice-side-icon">↳</span><span>Notices are PDFs hosted on SAL’s official domain. The institute’s circular is the source for deadlines, eligibility and required documents.</span></div></div><NoticeList /></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container admission-process"><div><span class="eyebrow">Admissions guidance</span><h2>Find the right<br><em>office to ask.</em></h2><p>Program eligibility, seat availability and selection processes vary by institute and admission authority. Start with the notice for your chosen program.</p></div><div class="admission-steps"><div><span>01</span><strong>Choose a program</strong><small>Use the program finder to narrow your options.</small></div><div><span>02</span><strong>Read its circular</strong><small>Check the current schedule and application instructions.</small></div><div><span>03</span><strong>Confirm with the institute</strong><small>Ask the admissions office about current vacancies and next steps.</small></div></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
